  "details": "# Suggestion \nAs a avatar creator I feel like it would be quite nice having the  **Earmuffs** feature use a parameter similar to the mute button.\nFor example:\nMute is tracked by the *MuteSelf* Parameter and  is a Bool Which is true or false.\nA Earmuffs implementation could be tracked by a *Earmuffed* parameter and also be stored as a Bool (*true* when enabled and *false* when disabled)  \nThis could allow me to put Earmuffs on my avatar when it is enabled!",
